<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Jan 21.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Cochin port on</p>
<p>January 21:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons	    Ship		     Berthing</p>
<p>		     (LDD/ULD)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Muriate of</p>
<p> Potash	    27,000 (ULD)     Flag Tom		 03/01</p>
<p>Crude		62,000 (ULD)     Motilal Nehru	  21/01</p>
<p>Raw Cashew	  5,500 (ULD)     Fennie		   12/01</p>
<p>Rock Phosphate   26,000 (ULD)     Mangal Desai	   15/01</p>
<p>High speed</p>
<p> diesel	    10,000 (LDD)     Julailal		 14/01</p>
<p>Zinc Concentrate  7,000 (ULD)     Ikan Tanda	     17/01</p>
<p>Cement		5,000 (ULD)     Pratap Gad	     17/01</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	    (Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Cochin)</p>
<p>	    -- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
